      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-prot">Protracted path:</strong> Talks continue without breakthrough, Hormuz remains partially closed (F4, 62% NO), and Knesset dissolution advances on a slow legislative track (N1, 55%) while fighting grinds at low intensity in Lebanon.</p>
      <p class="scenario-line"><strong class="label-desc">De-escalation path:</strong> Iran-US deal signed before June 5 (F3, 20% YES) triggers Hormuz reopening and ceasefire consolidation, with Knesset dissolution proceeding in a less militarized domestic political environment.</p>
